  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inventory of financing needs of EnDev supported companies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Open Capital will conduct research to gain an in-depth understanding of the financing challenges faced by EnDev portfolio companies and potential solutions, with the aim of developing effective interventions. Currently, the industry has a general understanding of the financial challenges in the energy access sector and potential solutions to these challenges.This assignment will examine different economic contexts, including countries with less attractive investment environments, with a specific focus on EnDev portfolio companies.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the study is to collect and analyze data on the financial needs and challenges of EnDev portfolio companies, considering factors such as technology type, financing type, company characteristics, and barriers to accessing finance. Following this analysis, Open Capital will draft conclusions and recommendations for effective interventions for EnDev.</narrative>
  </description>
